{
 "html": "<section class=\"section_process-eta\" id=\"eta\" data-frame=\"timeline\" aria-labelledby=\"eta-h\"><span class=\"ab_frame-label\" data-frame-label=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▢ timeline</span><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"padding-section-medium\"><div class=\"ab_sec-h\"><div class=\"ab_section-head is-flush\"><div class=\"text-style-eyebrow\">/eta · no guesses</div><h2 class=\"heading-style-h2\" id=\"eta-h\" data-split=\"\">What moves the <span class=\"t-outline\">timeline</span></h2></div><p class=\"ab_sec-h_lede text-size-lede\">Every mission gets real dates after the discovery call. These are the things that stretch or shorten the route.</p></div><div class=\"ab_eta_grid\"><div class=\"ab_eta_factors\"><div class=\"ab_eta_factor\"><div class=\"ab_eta_factor-name\">Scope<div class=\"ab_eta_factor-q\">How big is it?</div></div><div class=\"ab_eta_seg\" data-factor=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Scope\"><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">A few pages</span><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">A full site</span><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">A platform</span></div></div><div class=\"ab_eta_factor\"><div class=\"ab_eta_factor-name\">Content<div class=\"ab_eta_factor-q\">Is the copy ready?</div></div><div class=\"ab_eta_seg\" data-factor=\"1\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Content\"><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">Ready to go</span><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">Partly there</span><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">From zero</span></div></div><div class=\"ab_eta_factor\"><div class=\"ab_eta_factor-name\">Brand<div class=\"ab_eta_factor-q\">Is the brand set?</div></div><div class=\"ab_eta_seg\" data-factor=\"2\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Brand\"><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">Ready</span><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">Needs a refresh</span><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">From scratch</span></div></div><div class=\"ab_eta_factor\"><div class=\"ab_eta_factor-name\">3D + motion<div class=\"ab_eta_factor-q\">Anything custom?</div></div><div class=\"ab_eta_seg\" data-factor=\"3\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"3D + motion\"><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">None</span><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">A few moments</span><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">A signature piece</span></div></div><div class=\"ab_eta_factor\"><div class=\"ab_eta_factor-name\">Data<div class=\"ab_eta_factor-q\">Where does content live?</div></div><div class=\"ab_eta_seg\" data-factor=\"4\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Data\"><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">Static</span><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">In a CMS</span><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">Synced sources</span></div></div><div class=\"ab_eta_factor\"><div class=\"ab_eta_factor-name\">Sign-off<div class=\"ab_eta_factor-q\">Who makes the call?</div></div><div class=\"ab_eta_seg\" data-factor=\"5\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Sign-off\"><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">One person</span><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">Two or three</span><span class=\"ab_eta_opt\">A committee</span></div></div></div><div class=\"ab_eta_gauge\" data-selectable=\"\" data-name=\"Gauge / route length\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"ab_eta_dial\" data-gauge=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"ab_eta_out\"><div class=\"ab_eta_title\" data-eta-title=\"\">Standard orbit</div><p class=\"ab_eta_text\" data-eta-text=\"\">A full route with every waypoint. Most missions fly this one.</p></div><div class=\"ab_eta_adds\" data-eta-adds=\"\"></div><div class=\"ab_eta_note\">Not a quote · real dates come with the flight plan</div><div class=\"hide\" data-eta-buckets=\"\"><div class=\"ab_eta_bucket\"><div class=\"ab_eta_bucket-t\">Short hop</div><p class=\"ab_eta_bucket-p\">Fewer moving parts and fewer stops. The route goes almost straight from brief to launch.</p></div><div class=\"ab_eta_bucket\"><div class=\"ab_eta_bucket-t\">Standard orbit</div><p class=\"ab_eta_bucket-p\">A full route with every waypoint. Most missions fly this one.</p></div><div class=\"ab_eta_bucket\"><div class=\"ab_eta_bucket-t\">Deep-space mission</div><p class=\"ab_eta_bucket-p\">More stops, more people and more custom pieces. Worth it, and planned for from day one.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>",
 "css": ".section_process-eta{position:relative}\n.ab_eta_grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,0.9fr);align-items:start;grid-row-gap:clamp(24px,4vw,64px);grid-column-gap:clamp(24px,4vw,64px)}\n.ab_eta_factors{display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair)}\n.ab_eta_factor{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,0.8fr) minmax(0,1.6fr);align-items:center;grid-row-gap:12px;grid-column-gap:20px;padding-top:14px;padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair)}\n.ab_eta_factor-name{font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary)}\n.ab_eta_factor-q{margin-top:2px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;color:var(--_color---text--primary)}\n.ab_eta_seg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);border-right-width:1px;border-right-style:solid;border-right-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong)}\n.ab_eta_opt{display:block;padding-top:10px;padding-right:8px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:8px;border-right-width:1px;border-right-style:solid;border-right-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);font-size:11px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-align:center;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary);cursor:pointer}\n.ab_eta_gauge{position:sticky;top:110px;padding-top:clamp(18px,2.4vw,28px);padding-right:clamp(18px,2.4vw,28px);padding-bottom:clamp(18px,2.4vw,28px);padding-left:clamp(18px,2.4vw,28px);border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair);border-right-width:1px;border-right-style:solid;border-right-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair);border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair);border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair);background-color:var(--_color---neutral--glass)}\n.ab_eta_dial{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:300 / 170}\n.ab_eta_out{margin-top:10px;text-align:center}\n.ab_eta_title{font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(26px,2.6vw,38px);line-height:1;text-transform:uppercase}\n.ab_eta_text{max-width:38ch;margin-top:10px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;font-size:15px;color:var(--_color---text--secondary)}\n.ab_eta_adds{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;grid-row-gap:6px;grid-column-gap:6px;min-height:26px;margin-top:14px}\n.ab_eta_note{margin-top:14px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-align:center;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary)}\n.ab_eta_bucket{position:relative}\n.ab_eta_bucket-t{position:relative}\n.ab_eta_bucket-p{position:relative}\n@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n.ab_eta_grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}\n.ab_eta_gauge{position:relative;top:auto}\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 479px) {\n.ab_eta_factor{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}\n}\n"
}